 "summary": "Handle NULL terminated GNU AR extended name"
 "description": "We have an AR archive (a .lib file) whose extended name is terminated by a NULL instead of a line feed which causes an IOException (\"Failed to read entry: 0\"). It looks like ArArchiveInputStream.getExtendedName just needs to check namebuffer[i] for '\\012' *or* 0. The ar tool in latest GNU binutils seems to be able to handle this."
